WEBVTT

00:01:28.217 --> 00:01:30.567
and Dassen Island to the north --

00:01:30.591 --> 00:01:32.976
two of the penguins' main
breeding islands.

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:37.020
And exactly six years
and three days earlier,

00:01:37.044 --> 00:01:39.766
on June 20, 1994,

00:01:39.790 --> 00:01:42.686
a ship named the Apollo Sea
sank near Dassen Island,

00:01:42.710 --> 00:01:46.587
oiling 10,000 penguins,
half of which died.

00:01:47.254 --> 00:01:49.051
Now when the Treasure sank in 2000,

00:01:49.075 --> 00:01:51.976
it was the height
of the best breeding season

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.894
scientists had ever recorded
for the African penguin,

00:01:55.918 --> 00:01:58.885
which at the time, was listed
as a threatened species.

00:01:58.909 --> 00:02:01.643
And soon, nearly 20,000 penguins